# TBA -- script to copy agent files from this repo to a typical development project (frontend+backend) appropriately for each type of agent. This is a repeatable setup script that can be run after cloning and aliasing this repo and then as needed to update agent files in a user's project environment. It will copy files to the appropriate locations in the project structure (e.g. frontend instructions to frontend folder, backend instructions to backend folder) and can be customized with parameters for different project structures or agent types as needed.